                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group mod_touying clearfix" id="popup_divReport_KZY">
                            <label class="col-md-2 control-label">文件报告</label>
                            <div class="col-md-10">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.OpenReport();">提取可作业预报文件</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>



                        <div class="form-group mod_touying" id="popup_divLastContent_KZY">

                            <label class="col-md-2 control-label">上一节点意见</label>
                            <div class="col-md-10">
                                <textarea class="form-control" id="popup_txtLastContent_KZY" disabled></textarea>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group mod_touying" id="popup_divContent_KZY">

                            <label class="col-md-2 control-label">审批意见</label>
                            <div class="col-md-10">
                                <textarea class="form-control" id="popup_txtContent_KZY"></textarea>
                            </div>
                            
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group mod_touying" id="popup_divNextNode_KZY">

                            <label class="col-md-2 control-label lcjd_next">流程下一节点</label>
                            <div class="col-md-4 pr0">
                                <div class="lcjd_next_sp"><i class="icon iconfont">&#xe63e;</i><span id="popup_spanNextNodeName_KZY">分子公司审批</span></div>
                                <div class="nice-select">
                                    <input id="popup_txtNodeUserName_KZY" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="搜索" autocomplete="off" />
                                    <div class="search_div" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.ClearShjNodeUserName();" id="popup_divClearNodeName_KZY">
                                        <i class="fa fa-close"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <ul id="popup_ulNodeUserList_KZY" style="display:none;">
                                    </ul>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-1 text-center mt4">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary search_btn" style="width: 100%" id="popup_btnFindNodeUserName_KZY" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.FindShjNodeUserByName();">搜索</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-5 zhuyi_zt mt4">
                                注意：请按照流程节点审批要求，指定下一节点审批人。如果节点审批人选错，整个流程将不能通过或者退回。
                            </div>

                        </div>


                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="text-center sqzl_btn_box" id="popup_divSubmit_KZY">
                    <button class="btn btn-success" id="popup_btnSubmit_KZY" data-type="1" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.AddTaskSubmit(this);">申请</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-danger" id="popup_btnBack_KZY" data-type="0" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.AddTaskSubmit(this);">审批退回</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-warning" id="popup_btnCancel_KZY" data-type="3" onclick="SoftwareKZYHelper.AddTaskSubmit(this);">作废</button>
                </div>


            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

